{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24042","headline":"南池早春有怀 · 白居易","name":"南池早春有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝游北桥上，晚憩南塘畔。\n西日雪全销，东风冰尽泮。\n簁簁鱼尾掉，瞥瞥鹅毛换。\n泥煖草芽生，沙虚泉脉散。\n晴芳冒苔岛，宿润侵蒲岸。\n洛下日初长，江南春欲半。\n时光共抛掷，人事堪嗟叹。\n倚櫂忽寻思，去年池上伴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24042.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24042","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}